//=========================================== WAREHOUSE CONTROLLER ============================================
### GET all warehouse
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Create a new warehouse
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouse
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
    "name": "Warehouse name C",
    "location": "Street ABC Block XYZ"
}

### Show?
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
    "name": "Warehouse name AAAAAAAAAAAA"
}

### Delele a wareshouse
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/warehouse/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

